soc: cix: arbitrate Sky1 ACPI PCIe generic and vendor models

Sky1 firmware can expose generic PNP0A08 root bridges and CIXH2020 vendor
companion devices for the same controllers. Register an early scan handler
only for CIXTEK/SKY1EDK2 firmware. When both usable models exist, retain
the generic path and suppress the vendor companion; leave single-model
firmware unchanged.

Ignore devices that are neither present nor functional when deciding
whether a competing model exists. Keep routine arbitration messages at
debug level.

This stable 40070 identity replaces the PCIe half of the former broad
6.18 40050 patch. It also absorbs the former 7.x 40080 refinement and was
regenerated to remain independent of the now-retired GPU policy patch.

